; offline.sb — macOS sandbox profile for the deploy rehearsal (sandbox-exec -f offline.sb <cmd>): every outbound
; network connection is denied except to localhost, so nothing run under it can reach Cloudflare, R2 or any other
; host (not even DNS: the resolver socket is denied too). Verified: `curl https://1.1.1.1` -> "Couldn't connect",
; `curl https://example.com` -> "Could not resolve host", while wrangler dev / rclone / fake-s3 on 127.0.0.1 work.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network-outbound)
(allow network-outbound (remote ip "localhost:*"))
